PROBLEM STATEMENT
------------------
A university uses an AI assistant to evaluate scholarship applications based on a
student's academic score and annual family income. Design a prompt that determines
eligibility using predefined criteria.
Eligibility Criteria:
• Academic score must be at least 85%.
• Annual family income must not exceed ₹3,00,000.
• Both conditions must be satisfied to qualify.


PROMPT
------
Evaluate scholarship eligibility for students of a university based on academic score and annual family income.
The criteria for eligibility for a scholarship includes:
• Academic score must be at least 85%.
• Annual family income must not exceed ₹3,00,000.
• Both conditions must be satisfied to qualify.

Rules:
Never assume missing values
If either required value is missing, return INSUFFICIENT_DATA.
Return exactly one label: ELIGIBLE, NOT_ELIGIBLE, or INSUFFICIENT_DATA.
